    "headline": "India can't take growth for granted, FinMin warns as global rates rise and investors turn cautious",
    "body": "India's economy exhibited robust growth of 7.8 percent in the first quarter of FY27 and is projected to grow 7.3 percent in the next quarter. While domestic conditions appear resilient, external risks continue to challenge its investment appeal, particularly regarding trade relations with the United States and fluctuations in energy prices. The recent sovereign rating upgrade reflects strengthening fundamentals amid global uncertainties and cautious investor sentiment.",
