    "headline": "Stock market open or closed tomorrow on Eid Milad-un-Nabi 2026? Check NSE, BSE trading offs calendar",
    "body": "Despite Eid Milad-un-Nabi, BSE and NSE will operate on August 26, with normal trading but deferred settlements to August 27. The next holiday is Ganesh Chaturthi on September 14. Continuous trading is expected with no interruptions planned in September 2026.",
